        "description_pt": "This chic hotel, in the heart of Ibiza Town, is 100 metres from the marina. It features air-conditioned rooms with satellite TV with free Wi-Fi, and an outdoor pool. Parking is not available.\nRooms at El Hotel Pacha are bright and spacious, decorated in natural tones, All have a private balcony and seating area. Bathrooms feature bathrobes, slippers and a hairdryer.\nHotel Pacha’s restaurant serves creative, avant-garde cuisine. There is a snack bar, elegant terrace bar, and room service is available.\nThe hotel also offers free gym, pool area, sun loungers and day-time events at Destino Five Ibiza hotel, located 5 km away - open April 20,2026 to October 11,2026\nThe hotel concierge will be happy to help with restaurant and club reservations.",
